# Packages installed into Deluxe System 1 (Ubuntu 24.04 "noble"; main/universe/multiverse).
# One package per line. "#" starts a comment. Installed WITHOUT Recommends (keeps the ISO small),
# so anything a feature really needs is listed explicitly.
#
# Inkscape and OBS Studio are NOT here on purpose: they are offered as Flatpaks (from Flathub)
# in the Welcome app, which keeps the ISO under 4.7 GB. To bake them in, add `inkscape` and
# `obs-studio` below and expect roughly +450 MB.

## --- boot, installer, hardware ---------------------------------------------------------
casper
initramfs-tools
grub-pc
grub-pc-bin
grub-efi-amd64-bin
grub-efi-amd64-signed
grub-common
grub2-common
grub-gfxpayload-lists
shim-signed
